			"Message": "chore: Update submodules to latest versions\n\nUpdate multiple project submodules to their latest upstream commits:\n- Biome: 5fa37fc → a84f4e1\n- Microsoft: 6487938 → 7e00617\n- OXC: 98d6a35 → 73ab751\n- Rolldown: 13921c0 → 23d417d\n- SWC: b27e53f → b5398b7\n- Tauri: 8140280 → 56dafb7\n- Vercel: 1023b49 → b68fb8f\n\nThis routine maintenance ensures we incorporate the latest improvements and bug fixes from upstream dependencies. The updates were performed through standard submodule management workflows using automated version tracking tooling.",
